      "However, it is not for everyone. If you prioritize simplicity over capability, or if your team is resistant to learning new software, ClickUp may cause more friction than it solves. It requires commitment to set up and maintain. But if your team is willing to invest the initial week to configure it correctly, ClickUp is likely the last project management tool you will ever need to buy. For more comparisons on software that helps your business scale, check out our guide on <a href=\"/guides/best-crm-software-small-business-2026\">best CRM software for 2026</a> to see how ClickUp stacks up against dedicated sales tools."
